{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46410","headline":"题鹤鸣泉八韵 · 齐己","name":"题鹤鸣泉八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘹泪遗踪去，澄明物掩难。\n喷开山面碧，飞落寺门寒。\n汲引随缾满，分流逐处安。\n幽虫乘叶过，渴狖拥条看。\n上有危峰叠，旁宜怪石盘。\n冷吞双树影，甘润百毛端。\n异早闻镌玉，灵终别建坛。\n潇湘在何处，终日自波澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}